   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "What hurts is the subject",
     "texto": [
      "In Portuguese you say **dói-me a cabeça** (my head hurts): what hurts goes after the verb, just as in Spanish.",
      "If more than one thing hurts, use **doem**: **doem-me os olhos** (my eyes hurt)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Who it hurts",
     "texto": [
      "**dói-me** (it hurts me), **dói-te** (it hurts you), **dói-lhe** (it hurts you formal, or him / her), **dói-nos** (it hurts us). With «lhe» you speak to someone formal or talk about another person: **doem-lhe os olhos** (their eyes hurt)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
